   "inputs": [],
   "outputs": [],
   "widgets_values": [
    "HaDeS MOSS Suite - Control (color / depth)\n\n1. Load a control adapter in MOSS Multi-LoRA (e.g. moss-color-depth-control from\n   darask0/MOSS-Image-color-depth-control, trained on MOSS-Image Base). Keep it at 1.0:\n   ComfyUI replaces its widened video_embedder at full strength anyway.\n2. Depth Anything V2 (comfyui_controlnet_aux) extracts the depth map (near is white).\n   MOSS Control resizes the maps in pixels to the latent before the VAE.\n3. color_mode: off = depth only (clothes and colors from the prompt);\n   flat regions = connect a photo to color_map, blurred and reduced to a few flat colors;\n   as given = a real segmentation map (a photo there makes the adapter copy its texture).\n4. Measured on RTX 5090 (tools/RESULTS.md): Base or SFT at 25 steps takes ~14.1-14.2 s;\n   with Turbo 8-steps v1.0 (8 steps, CFG 1), ~3.3 s (4.3x faster), keeping pose fidelity.\n5. Lower strength (< 1.0) or end_percent (e.g. 0.75) to give the final steps more freedom."
   ],
   "properties": {}
  }
